>>
Rule 1 (images must be 3-D or 4-D as required by the API; suppresses ValueError for invalid rank)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 3 ∨ ndim(v_1) = 4
>>
Rule 2 (images must have non-empty dimensions; covers both 3-D and 4-D inputs)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 4 then (shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 3) ≥ 1) else (ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) ≥ 1)
>>
Rule 3 (channels-last requirement: the last dimension (channels) must be present and positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ shape(v_1, 3) ≥ 1) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) ≥ 1)
>>
Rule 4 (images must have a queryable shape; suppresses: AttributeError: 'Tensor' object has no attribute 'get_shape')
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 5 (name, if provided, must be one of the allowed strings in this environment)
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 = "ii" ∨ v_2 = "ii->i" ∨ v_2 = "i,j->ij" ∨ v_2 = "bij,bjk->bik" ∨ v_2 = "...ij->...ji" ∨ v_2 = "bn,anm,bm->ba" ∨ v_2 = "none" ∨ v_2 = "sum" ∨ v_2 = "max" ∨ v_2 = "min" ∨ v_2 = "prod" ∨ v_2 = "relu" ∨ v_2 = "tanh" ∨ v_2 = "sigmoid" ∨ v_2 = "softmax" ∨ v_2 = "elu" ∨ v_2 = "selu" ∨ v_2 = "gelu" ∨ v_2 = "swish" ∨ v_2 = "softplus" ∨ v_2 = "linear" ∨ v_2 = "valid" ∨ v_2 = "same" ∨ v_2 = "causal" ∨ v_2 = "channels_last" ∨ v_2 = "channels_first"
>>
Rule 7 (all dimensions must be positive for valid 3-D or 4-D images)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, 3] : shape(v_1, i) > 0) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, 2] : shape(v_1, i) > 0)
>>
Rule 8 (channels dimension must exist and be at least 1)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 4 then shape(v_1, 3) ≥ 1 else shape(v_1, 2) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 9 (spatial dimensions must be at least 1)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ ∀i ∈ [1, 2] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 1) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 1)
>>
Rule 10 (images dtype must be floating-point)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8
>>
Rule 11 (exclude unsupported or non-numeric dtypes)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 9 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 10 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 11 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 12
